<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰφ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit for dyeing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόκκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					1.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοτάνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), ἡ,
				<i>art of dyeing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.353
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.228b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				98.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίβλοι βαφικαί,</span> in Alchemy, books
				<i>on gilding and silvering,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Democr.
			</span></i> ap. Syn.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.57
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καῦσις β.</span> Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.208B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαφικόν, τό,</span> form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰνδικόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.92
			</span></i>.</div>
